Apps bundled with Sukhi Play
============================

Sukhi Play ships a small number of apps so that a child with no internet
connection still has something to open. They come from two places.

Ours live under apps/<name>/, built from the source under playground/<name>/
by scripts/playground-app.mjs. They are under the Sukhi Play Personal Use
Licence, like the rest of this project.

    apps/colouring
        Sukhi Colouring, derived from the original work of Kids Coloring,
        copyright (c) 2026 oh-namgyu, MIT licence.
        https://github.com/oh-namgyu/kids-coloring

    apps/studio
        Jazz's Studio, made for Sukhi Play.
        https://github.com/meSingh/jazz-studio

Everybody else's live under vendor/<name>/, included under their own licences
and unmodified except where noted, with the upstream licence in
vendor/<name>/LICENSE, the exact commit it was built from in
vendor/<name>/UPSTREAM, and any changes we made recorded in
vendor/<name>/patch.mjs.

    vendor/magic-smash
        Magic Smash, copyright (c) 2026 Evandro Meneses, MIT licence.
        https://github.com/MenesesEvandro/MagicSmash
        Changed for this build: the Google Fonts stylesheet removed, and the
        font stack extended so it falls back to the system face at once.

    vendor/little-explorer
        Little Explorer, copyright (c) 2026 pazarman, MIT licence.
        https://github.com/pazarman/little-explorer
        Unchanged.

